::U2UA_L6_Q01::Fitness data are {=evidence about activity and response~only wearable readings~class rankings~medical diagnoses}

::U2UA_L6_Q02::An activity log should use {=consistent fields and understandable units~random fields each session~only memory~classmate comparisons}

::U2UA_L6_Q03::A baseline is {=a starting point for comparison~a final grade~a diagnosis~a guaranteed target}

::U2UA_L6_Q04::A trend is {=a general direction across multiple observations~one unusual data point~any device reading~a causal proof}

::U2UA_L6_Q05::Quantitative data include {=duration and RPE number~talk-test description only~movement-quality note only~enjoyment only}

::U2UA_L6_Q06::Qualitative data include {=talk test and recovery description~minutes only~heart-rate number only~days per week only}


